<h2>Environment Bootstrap</h2>
<p>
  To verify or install prerequisites across Linux (<code>apt</code>, <code>dnf</code>, <code>pacman</code>, <code>apk</code>, <code>zypper</code>), macOS (<code>brew</code>), or Windows (<code>winget</code>, <code>scoop</code>, <code>choco</code>), use <code>bootstrap.ps1</code>:
</p>

{{ terminalFrame({
  title: "pwsh — bootstrap verification & installation",
  stream: "stdout",
  exitCode: 0,
  code: "# Check installed SDKs, FFmpeg/FFprobe capabilities, and SQLite without modifying the machine
pwsh -NoProfile -File ./bootstrap.ps1 -CheckOnly

# Install missing prerequisites (.NET 10 SDK, FFmpeg, SQLite)
pwsh -NoProfile -File ./bootstrap.ps1"
}) }}

