<h3>Developer Build Runner (<code>fluxb.ps1</code>)</h3>
<p>
  The repository includes <code>fluxb.ps1</code> for single-command local and CI validation, including NuGet vulnerability auditing, formatting checks, test filtering, and test-artifact path/secret scrubbing:
</p>

{{ terminalFrame({
  title: "pwsh — fluxb.ps1 tasks",
  stream: "stdout",
  exitCode: 0,
  code: "# Default pipeline: Restore -> Build -> Test (Debug)
./fluxb.ps1

# Full CI verification pipeline (Release, locked restore, vulnerability audit, format check, scrubbed test reports)
./fluxb.ps1 CI -Configuration Release -Ci -AutoVersion

# Run a single test project or filter
./fluxb.ps1 Test -Project Infrastructure -Filter '*FFmpegRunner*'

# Publish the NativeAOT release executable (flux) to artifacts/publish/linux-x64 (ADR 0003)
./fluxb.ps1 Publish -Configuration Release -Runtime linux-x64 -Aot

# Publish the framework-dependent portable fallback to artifacts/publish/portable
./fluxb.ps1 Publish -Configuration Release -Portable"
}) }}

